  "question": {
    "text": "If $f\\left(\\frac{x-4}{x+2}\\right)=2 x+1,(x \\in R=\\{1,-2\\})$, then $\\int f$ ( $x$ ) $d x$ is equal to (where $C$ is a constant of integration)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "qi1NL",
      "text": "\n$12 \\log _e|1-x|-3 x+c$\n",
